   ```css
   .promo-banner {
     position: relative;
     overflow: hidden; /* Prevents horizontal scroll if graphic overflows */
     width: 100%;
   }
   .promo-banner__graphic {
     position: absolute;
     right: 0;
     top: 0;
     height: 100%;
     width: auto; /* Or a specific responsive width */
     max-width: 100%;
   }
   ```

